  <h1>About this portfolio</h1>

  <p class="lede">
    Three things are hard to show on a resume: that you understand a business well
    enough to know which problems are worth solving, that you can turn raw public data
    into something trustworthy, and that you can encode that understanding so a machine
    can act on it. This site is the evidence for those three claims.
  </p>

